 ## Background
-The method was introduced by Kraus and Ertl [S1, S2]. It is discussed in the context of image-space visibility ordering for cell projection volume rendering of unstructured data [S1, S2]. The method could be extended to nonconvex meshes using the SXMPVO algorithm [S1, S2].
